    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Choose how this ends... you mean like, giving myself up to the enemy? To be captured and mocked? Or is there something more... dignified? I just feel like there's no way to wash the shame off. Everything feels so heavy. Is there any way to leave with some shred of honor left?",
